# EcoGlobe Frontend Team Walkthrough

## Purpose

This guide gives the team a structured frontend walkthrough of EcoGlobe from the Admin, Buyer, and Seller roles.

The clearest overall product story is:

Seller lists material → Buyer discovers and purchases it → Logistics and contracts fulfill it → Escrow settles it → Admin governs and audits the complete lifecycle.

---

